# A newsletter with a style block: its rules are inlined (the look survives cleaning), a wrapper with a background, a 600 px table,
# remote pictures, an unsubscribe footer. Designed; the footer is folded.
subject: The Garden Letter, November
layout: designed
fold_from: 1
expect: 0 NEW_CONTENT show
expect: 1 DISCLAIMER collapse
authored: November in the garden: plant your tulip bulbs now for a spring full of colour.
authored: Our autumn workshop on pruning fruit trees opens for booking this week.
--- html
<html><head><style>
body { background-color: #f3efe6; margin: 0; }
.wrap { background-color: #f3efe6; width: 100%; }
.card { background-color: #ffffff; width: 600px; }
h1 { font-family: Georgia, serif; color: #2f4f2f; font-size: 28px; }
p { font-family: Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif; color: #333333; line-height: 1.5; }
.button { background-color: #2f4f2f; color: #ffffff; padding: 12px 20px; }
.footer p { font-size: 11px; color: #888888; }
a:hover { color: red; }
.x:is(.y) { color: red; }
td:has(img) { padding: 0; }
</style></head><body><table class="wrap" width="100%" cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0"><tr><td align="center"><table class="card" width="600" cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0"><tr><td><img src="https://news.example.com/header.png" width="600" alt="The Garden Letter"></td></tr><tr><td><h1>November in the garden</h1><p>November in the garden: plant your tulip bulbs now for a spring full of colour.</p><img src="https://news.example.com/tulips.jpg" width="600" alt=""><p>Our autumn workshop on pruning fruit trees opens for booking this week.</p><a class="button" href="https://news.example.com/book">Book a place</a></td></tr><tr><td class="footer"><p>You receive this letter because you subscribed at our shop. <a href="https://news.example.com/unsubscribe">Unsubscribe</a> or <a href="https://news.example.com/web">view it in your browser</a>.</p></td></tr></table></td></tr></table><img src="https://track.example.com/open.gif" width="1" height="1"></body></html>
